+<!doctype html><html lang="es-AR" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Cobertura y disponibilidad · Changeo</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><header th:replace="~{shell :: header}"></header><main id="main" th:with="previous=${composition.previous.orElse(null)}"><h1>Cobertura y disponibilidad</h1><p>Paso 2 de 2 · Guardar en privado</p><p th:text="${composition.title}"></p><form th:action="@{/marketplace/drafts}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="hidden" name="stage" th:value="${composition.stage}"><label for="province">Provincia</label><select id="province" name="province" required><option th:each="province : ${provinces}" th:value="${province}" th:text="${province}" th:selected="${previous != null and province == previous.province}"></option></select><label for="area">Zona amplia o localidad</label><input id="area" name="area" maxlength="80" th:value="${previous != null ? previous.area : ' '}" required><p>No ingresar calle, número, domicilio ni coordenadas.</p><fieldset><legend>Modalidades (una o varias)</legend><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="modes" value="LOCAL" th:checked="${previous != null and previous.modes.contains(T(ar.changeo.identity.api.JobContext.FulfillmentMode).LOCAL)}">Presencial</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="modes" value="REMOTE" th:checked="${previous != null and previous.modes.contains(T(ar.changeo.identity.api.JobContext.FulfillmentMode).REMOTE)}">A distancia</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="modes" value="SHIPPED" th:checked="${previous != null and previous.modes.contains(T(ar.changeo.identity.api.JobContext.FulfillmentMode).SHIPPED)}">Con envío</label></fieldset><label for="availability">Disponibilidad orientativa</label><input id="availability" name="availability" maxlength="300" th:value="${previous != null ? previous.availability : ' '}"><div th:if="${!composition.type.profile()}"><label for="amount">Expectativa de precio o presupuesto en ARS (opcional)</label><input id="amount" name="amount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" th:value="${previous != null ? previous.amount.orElse(null) : null}"><p>En blanco: A convenir. No es un acuerdo ni un cobro.</p><label for="deadline">Fecha orientativa (opcional)</label><input id="deadline" name="deadline" type="date" th:value="${previous != null ? previous.deadline.orElse(null) : null}"></div><label th:if="${composition.type.profile()}" class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="badgeOptIn" value="true" th:checked="${previous != null and previous.badgeOptIn}">Mostrar insignia opcional vigente cuando este perfil esté aprobado</label><label for="uploads">Portafolio o adjuntos nuevos (hasta cuatro; 1 MiB cada uno)</label><input id="uploads" name="uploads" type="file" multiple><p>Cada revisión usa archivos nuevos. PNG/JPEG y texto UTF-8 tienen inspección local limitada; PDF/STL y otros archivos quedan en cuarentena.</p><button type="submit">Guardar borrador y ver estado</button></form></main><footer th:replace="~{shell :: footer}"></footer></body></html>
